{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"81615","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/81615","key":"MC-244137","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"03/Dec/21 4:53 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>In the server.properties file <tt>level-seed</tt> isn't there&nbsp;and isn't generating when turning on server.</p>\n\n<p>Adding the line manually allows the server to generate a world with a custom seed.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Start a server, and wait for the files to generate</li>\n\t<li>Read through server.properties<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> No line for the level seed exists</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedbehavior\"></a>Expected behavior</h3>\n<p>The <tt>level-seed</tt> line would be present in the server.properties file by default, but would be left blank.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"16/Jan/22 10:07 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/105483","id":"105483","filename":"server.properties","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-manag